# Cat-Gator ({6}{B}, lifelink): "When this creature enters, it deals damage equal to the number of Swamps you control to any target"
# (CR 205.3i, 120.3). Bot1 controls a Swamp and Bayou (a Swamp Forest) on turn 3 and Bot2 a Swamp of its own, which does not count,
# so Bot2 is dealt 2, not 3, and Cat-Gator's lifelink gains Bot1 that much (CR 702.15b). A land is no target ("any target" is a
# creature, player, planeswalker or battle).

